Hi Philippe,

I think you might have to add the argument .packages to the "foreach" call
like so:

ameliapar <- function(x, m=7, p2s=2, ...) {
  foreach (i = 1:m,
           .combine = "ameliabind",
           .packages="Amelia") %dopar% {
             amelia(x, m=1, p2s=p2s, ...)
           }
}

ameliapar(x = africa, m=7, cs = "country", ts = "year", logs = "gdp_pc")


Hope that helps!

Cheers,
matt.

